Description: Omarchy-compatible Hyprland session for Ubuntu - fonts
 Motanka is an Omarchy-compatible Hyprland layer for Ubuntu. It installs
 next to the current desktop as a separate login session, follows
 upstream Omarchy, and removes cleanly.
 .
 This package holds the fonts upstream Omarchy's bar, menus and terminals
 use that Ubuntu does not ship: JetBrainsMono Nerd Font and JetBrainsMono
 Nerd Font Mono from Nerd Fonts 3.5.1, in Regular, Bold, Italic and Bold
 Italic. They are installed in /opt/motanka/share/fonts, which only the
 Motanka session's font configuration lists, so other sessions do not see
 them.
